     Mirrors the BrightScript sg.script.type_fixed (type="text/brightscript"). This
     value is NOT in the official RokuSceneGraph.xsd enum (which fixes
     "text/brightscript"); it is a BrighterScript-toolchain extra that selects the
     .bs dialect, parsed as the distinct ScriptTypeBsAttValue so the injection layer
     can tell the two dialects apart. -->
